WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:20:00.000
Project JoyTwin on Guard Bounty Contract and Settlement (With Experience, 3rd Attempt): recognizing from Attempt 1 that the 320 HP Ogre cannot be soloed with novice gear, JoyTwin accepts the 1,000-coin contract, lands 7 tagging hits to register quest credit, draws the Ogre into the high-level town guard to let the guard kill it, and claims the 1,000-coin payout at 100 HP in 553.6s.
